T"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCFYoBw",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCFcoCA",null,null,null,[4],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["新店北新路，被這家「初原麵場」充滿日式風格的木質裝潢所吸引。在繁忙的街道旁，這家店給人一種平靜的溫馨感。走進店內，簡約的日系佈置讓人放鬆，雖然是走平價路線，但整體的用餐氛圍卻相當精緻。\n我點了他們的招牌「焙煎雞白湯拉麵」。湯頭一上桌，那股濃郁的焙煎香氣撲鼻而來。喝下一口，湯頭醇厚卻不膩口，帶有一種獨特的煙燻焦香味，這是在一般拉麵店很少能品嚐到的層次感。麵條的部分選用的是細麵，吸附湯汁的能力極佳，軟硬適中，每一口都能感受到湯頭與麵條的完美融合。\n配料方面也毫不含糊，叉燒肉經過炙燒，帶點微焦的油脂香氣，入口即化。最讓我驚艷的是裡頭大量的碎白菜，為濃郁的湯底增添了一抹清甜，也讓整體口感更加平衡。如果喜歡吃辣的人，非常推薦加一點店家的特製辣醬，香辣的後勁會讓湯頭的鮮味提升到另一個層次。\n整體來說，這是一次非常滿意的用餐體驗。在新店北新路這一帶，能以如此親民的價格吃到水準之上的拉麵，實在非常難得。無論是獨自一人下班後的簡單晚餐，還是與好友小聚，初原麵場都是一個絕佳的選擇。下次經過，我一定會再來嘗試其他口味！",null,[0,92]]]],[null,1778204802000000,1778204802000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZ1A1SUhWTnl6cnZrZHFFYko3UTdpZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfZ1A1SUhWTnl6cnZrZHFFYko3UTdpZxoSQ2dzSWdvSDF6d1lRMzVqMkZn\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ_2MIWCgJ"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXVFUxRk1WQllla0pSVm01Q1NFOVdhREZSYW14cFdXczRkMVpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXVFUxRk1WQllla0pSVm01Q1NFOVdhREZSYW14cFdXczRkMVpWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXVFUxRk1WQllla0pSVm01Q1NFOVdhREZSYW14cFdXczRkMVpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBXVFUxRk1WQllla0pSVm01Q1NFOVdhREZSYW14cFdXczRkMVpWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?