tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCHUoAg",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_MEAL_TYPE"],"用餐類型為何？",[[[["E:DINNER"],"晚餐",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3YcHCHgoAA"]],1],null,null,"餐點類型",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCHcoAw",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3YcHCHooAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCHkoBA",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_FOOD_ASPECT"],"餐點",null,null,null,"餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCHsoBQ",null,null,null,[3],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_SERVICE_ASPECT"],"服務",null,null,null,"服務",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCHwoBg",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1],[["GUIDED_DINING_ATMOSPHERE_ASPECT"],"氣氛",null,null,null,"氣氛",null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ3IcHCH0oBw",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["一、食物\n1. 我點的是特濃雞白湯+溏心蛋\n2. 湯頭沒有很濃，我期待的是像京都的藍天拉麵那種濃度，這方面略顯失望，但湯頭味道不錯，好像還有一點微微的奶香？最後我有全部喝完。\n3. 肉像火鍋肉片一樣薄，沒特別優。\n4. 洋蔥很多，不錯！\n5. 青菜是白菜不是最常見的高麗菜，雖是首見但這樣沒有比較好吃，高麗菜有無可取代的甜味，具有中和鹹湯頭的功效，而白菜跟這個湯頭沒有很搭。\n6. 麵本身沒有香味，也不是我喜歡的硬麵\n7. 溏心蛋很大顆！蠻好吃的，硬要說缺點就是不太入味，蛋白的顏色才會這麼白，但還是算好吃\n8. 有提供飲用水無限續。更難得的是也有提供熱水，這真的很棒！沒什麼店家有提供熱水。\n9. 整體來說，這碗拉麵我並沒有給予很高的評價，但勉強有中等偏上。\n\n二、環境\n1. 裝潢色調得宜，淺色木紋在視覺上非常心曠神怡。\n2. 氣氛舒適愜意，悠閒自在。尤其我晚上八點多才來，店裡幾乎沒別的客人，我也不用急著走，還可以在這邊悠閒的寫評論。\n3. 衛生整潔非常好。\n4. 背景音樂是有點搖滾風格和動畫風格的日文歌，這還不錯。或許是現在沒什麼客人所以聽起來有一點太大聲，但這沒什麼關係。我去每一家拉麵店都會在意背景音樂是不是日文歌。\n5. 取餐櫃檯有一瓶噴霧的75%酒精，這點非常好！\n6. 店內有許多日本傳統風格的裝飾，有掛畫也有擺設，很有氣氛！\n7. 桌旁的牆上有貼注意事項，相當貼心。\n\n三、服務\n1. 服務態度非常好。\n2. 當我說沒有要申請會員集點時，店員沒有任何的試圖說服，直接請我入座。這個很棒！\n\n四、其它\n1. 烘碗機裡面有一個杯子上面竟黏了一個乾掉的蔥花。\n2. 位於捷運七張站旁，步行5分鐘內可到，屬於大眾運輸友善餐廳。\n3. 點餐機的步驟引導相當清晰明確。\n\n五、總結\n這家店的環境和氣氛很優，是個放鬆心情的好地方，交通也方便。至於拉麵，如果你只是想找個不錯的晚餐，這家OK，但如果你是喜愛四處品嚐拉麵的拉麵重度愛好者，這家可能不會讓你很滿足。大概是這樣。",null,[0,87]]]],[null,1768139451000000,1768139451000000,"7 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfOVQ0LUs0T2trVXI5bXlTSTBDTGlRdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfOVQ0LUs0T2trVXI5bXlTSTBDTGlRdxoSQ2dzSXU5V095d1lReHEyT2ZR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjv6tXjydKWAxWGm68BHTu6DCkQ_2MIfigI"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTJOWE1XcGxSMXBWVkZSR05HUXdSWHBQU0ZFelVsVlJlVll4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTJOWE1XcGxSMXBWVkZSR05HUXdSWHBQU0ZFelVsVlJlVll4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTJOWE1XcGxSMXBWVkZSR05HUXdSWHBQU0ZFelVsVlJlVll4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTJOWE1XcGxSMXBWVkZSR05HUXdSWHBQU0ZFelVsVlJlVll4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTJOWE1XcGxSMXBWVkZSR05HUXdSWHBQU0ZFelVsVlJlVll4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/13468169772890267202/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnN3TTJOWE1XcGxSMXBWVkZSR05HUXdSWHBQU0ZFelVsVlJlVll4UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的評價與建議，\n我們將再加強店內清潔，確保用餐環境品質。",null,[0,31]]]],[null,null,8672,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swM2NXMWplR1pVVFRGNGQwRXpPSFEzUlVReVYxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x2407843a4aa34efe!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk03cW1jeGZUTTF4d0EzOHQ3RUQyV1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swM2NXMWplR1pVVFRGNGQwRXpPSFEzUlVReVYxRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2swM2NXMWplR1pVVFRGNGQwRXpPSFEzUlVReVYxRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUN